From 80b7829df63d8be9249dd96dcf63cd92d8748346 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 02:19:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(help): Replay reviews and Coaching guides, linked from
 each page

Add the "Reviews & coaching" help topic with two articles:
/help/replay-reviews (public: how it works, asking, writing a review,
who can review, karma and badges, closing and sharing, blocking and
reporting) and /help/coaching (signed-in and noindex: roles and
linking, the Locker, practice sharing, practice plans, sessions).

The help system gains section anchors (a heading `id`, rendered as the
element id on /help/<slug> and focused inside the HelpLink sheet via
`anchor`), and a `noindex` flag that adds a robots noindex tag and
keeps the article out of the sitemap.

Entry points: "How it works" in the /reviews and /reviews/mine
headers (visible signed out too), "How to ask" beside "Ask about one
of your games" in place of its hover-only title, "How coaching works"
in the Coaching tab row and on the invite-only screen, and a "Why?"
link plus "Get the desktop app" on the review page's comment gates.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KG8e5a59qtUDJJY3Fm1hxC
